  "A set of GoHighLevel workflows covering lead nurturing, appointment management, payment processing and instalment plans.",
  "Lead nurturing creates or updates the contact, sends a welcome email, then value emails and SMS on a schedule. Appointment workflows confirm bookings by email and SMS and handle reschedules. Payment workflows apply payments, send receipts and track instalments with on-time, overdue and final-reminder branches. Further workflows cover lead generation, follow-up, email campaigns, Facebook posting and SMS campaigns."
